rooms_desc ({"  You entered in the hall of Dorr's house. He is a nice person.He invites you to look at the rest of his house too, to the south isthe English part of the house, to the east is the Hungaryan part.You can see a big window on the western wall, a shoes-shelf and a cloath-rack on the northern wall.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
